FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tu as vu ce temps magnifique ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Pour une fois, je sens que quelque
chose de bien va arriver{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Il tempo promette bene!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Ho la sensazione che oggi
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}sarà una giornata speciale!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Hoy hace mucho sol!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Esta va a ser una de esas noches
perfectas para mirar las estrellas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡ya lo verás!

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Has levantado la vista del suelo?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Ha salido el arcoíris!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}¿Qué es lo que se supone que hay
al final del arcoíris?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Hai visto che cielo?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Gli arcobaleni sono troppo forti!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Ti chiedi mai cosa ci sarà
in fondo all'arcobaleno...?

{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Ma guarda che spettacolo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non avrei mai pensato di riuscire
a vedere un doppio arcobaleno{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
e invece eccolo qui! Mitico!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}The weather is so nice today!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}It should be clear skies tonight,
and seeing how cold it'll get{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
We just might be in for a treat!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}I'm talking about the aurora!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}You've gotta believe it'll happen!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugün hava pek güzel!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
